WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.325 line:84%
That's session one.

2
00:00:01.325 --> 00:00:04.640 line:84%
And here's the best part: once you hit Submit,

3
00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.080 line:84%
I have everything I need —

4
00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:10.040 line:84%
there's nothing to print, nothing to email, nothing else to do.

5
00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:12.420 line:84%
Just two easy things on Friday.

6
00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:14.800 line:84%
Hold on to your notebook with your notes in it —

7
00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.570 line:84%
I'll come around and pick it up.

8
00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:18.800 line:84%
And I'll bring you a printed copy of your

9
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.210 line:84%
