10
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.720 line:84%
Session two, we go deeper —

11
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.580 line:84%
the teacher chapters: standing in your students' shoes, prompting

12
00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:31.205 line:84%
with purpose, and teaching kids to use these tools

13
00:00:31.205 --> 00:00:33.065 line:84%
with agency instead of dependence.

14
00:00:33.065 --> 00:00:35.405 line:84%
Thank you for completing this training —

15
00:00:35.405 --> 00:00:37.825 line:84%
and for the time and heart you put into it.

16
00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:38.740 line:84%
See you there.
